6	//! fronted by the auth middleware ([`auth`]) plus a request-body size limit and renders failures
7	//! through the OpenAI-compatible error envelope ([`error`]). The inbound chat-completion request
8	//! DTO ([`dto`]) is parsed only to read `model`/`stream`.
